40294.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Synthetic monitoring — skriptlar yoki headless brauzer bot'lari muhim **foydalanuvchi yo'llarini** (login, qidiruv, savatga qo'shish, to'lov) muntazam (masalan har 1–5 daqiqada), turli joylardan **avtomatik bajaradi**. Haqiqiy foydalanuvchilar muammoga duch kelishidan oldin — hatto kechasi trafik yo'q paytda ham — nosozlikni topadi.

### Turlari
- **API tekshiruvlari** — bir nechta ketma-ket so'rov (token olish -> savat -> buyurtma).
- **Brauzer tekshiruvlari** — haqiqiy brauzer (Playwright) sahifalarni ochadi, tugmalarni bosadi, JS xatolari va yuklanish vaqtini o'lchaydi.
- **Oddiy uptime** — HTTP 200 (blackbox).

### Misol (Playwright uslubida)
```js
test('checkout flow', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('https://shop.example.com');
  await page.fill('#search', 'test-product');
  await page.click('text=Qo\'shish');
  await page.click('#cart');
  await expect(page.locator('#total')).toBeVisible();
  // to'lov — test kartasi bilan, maxsus test akkaunti
});
```
Vositalar: Grafana Synthetic Monitoring (k6), Datadog Synthetics, Checkly, AWS CloudWatch Synthetics, Pingdom.

### Foydalari
- Trafik kam bo'lsa ham doimiy signal (SLI uchun ham).
- Turli regionlardan — geografik muammolar (CDN, DNS).
- Deploy'dan keyin darhol tekshiruv (smoke test).
- Uchinchi tomon bog'liqliklarni (to'lov provayderi) to'liq yo'lda tekshirish.

### Nozikliklar
- Test ma'lumotlari: maxsus test akkauntlari, test to'lovlari; analitika va biznes metrikalaridan ajratish.
- Yolg'on alert'lar: bir nechta joydan tasdiq kerak.
- Skriptlar UI o'zgarganda buziladi — egasi va yangilash jarayoni.

**Senior nuqta:** Synthetic — "ma'lum yo'llar ishlayaptimi?" deb so'raydi, RUM — "haqiqiy foydalanuvchilar nima boshdan kechirmoqda?". Birinchisi erta va barqaror signal, ikkinchisi to'liq rasm. Kritik biznes yo'llari uchun synthetic tekshiruvni page darajasidagi alert'ga ulash — eng ishonchli signallardan biri.

40493.a:
**Qisqa javob:** OpenTelemetry Collector — telemetriya (metrika, log, trace) uchun **vendor-neytral** qabul qilish, qayta ishlash va eksport qilish xizmati. U **pipeline**'lardan iborat: har signal turi uchun alohida **receiver -> processor'lar -> exporter** zanjiri. Odatda ikki qatlamda joylashtiriladi: **agent** (har node'da, DaemonSet) va **gateway** (markaziy, masshtablanadigan deployment) — og'ir ishlov (tail sampling, PII tozalash) gateway'da.

### Konfiguratsiya
```yaml
receivers:
  otlp: { protocols: { grpc: {}, http: {} } }
  prometheus:
    config: { scrape_configs: [{ job_name: k8s-pods, kubernetes_sd_configs: [{ role: pod }] }] }
  filelog: { include: [/var/log/pods/*/*/*.log] }

processors:
  memory_limiter: { check_interval: 1s, limit_percentage: 80, spike_limit_percentage: 20 }
  k8sattributes: {}                       # pod, namespace, deployment atributlari
  attributes/pii:
    actions: [{ key: user.email, action: delete }, { key: http.request.header.authorization, action: delete }]
  tail_sampling:
    decision_wait: 10s
    policies:
    - { name: errors, type: status_code, status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] } }
    - { name: slow, type: latency, latency: { threshold_ms: 1000 } }
    - { name: rest, type: probabilistic, probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 10 } }
  batch: { send_batch_size: 8192, timeout: 5s }

exporters:
  prometheusremotewrite: { endpoint: http://mimir/api/v1/push }
  otlphttp/loki: { endpoint: http://loki:3100/otlp }
  otlp/tempo: { endpoint: tempo:4317, tls: { insecure: true } }

connectors:
  spanmetrics: {}                         # trace'lardan RED metrikalari (sampling'dan oldin)

service:
  pipelines:
    traces:          { receivers: [otlp], processors: [memory_limiter, k8sattributes, attributes/pii, batch], exporters: [spanmetrics, otlp/tempo-sampler] }
    metrics:         { receivers: [otlp, prometheus, spanmetrics], processors: [memory_limiter, k8sattributes, batch], exporters: [prometheusremotewrite] }
    logs:            { receivers: [otlp, filelog], processors: [memory_limiter, k8sattributes, attributes/pii, batch], exporters: [otlphttp/loki] }
```
(Tail sampling odatda alohida gateway pipeline'ida, trace ID bo'yicha load balancing'dan keyin.)

### Muhim processor'lar
- **memory_limiter** — birinchi bo'lishi kerak: xotira chegaraga yetsa, ma'lumotni rad etib backpressure beradi (OOM o'rniga).
- **batch** — eksport samaradorligi.
- **k8sattributes / resourcedetection** — kontekst qo'shish.
- **filter / transform** — keraksiz ma'lumotni tashlash (xarajat).

### Ishonchlilik
- Gateway'ni HA va HPA bilan; tail sampling uchun `loadbalancing` exporter (trace ID bo'yicha) — bir trace bitta instance'ga.
- `sending_queue` + `file_storage` — backend vaqtincha ishlamasa disk buferi.
- Collector'ning o'z metrikalari (rad etilgan/tashlangan ma'lumot) monitoring.

**Senior nuqta:** Collector — telemetriya "router"i: vendor almashtirish, xarajatni boshqarish (filtr, sampling) va maxfiylik (PII tozalash) shu yerda markazlashadi. Uning o'zi ham kritik infratuzilma — u yiqilsa, incident paytida ko'rinish yo'qoladi; shuning uchun meta-monitoring va backpressure sozlamalari shart.

40845.a:
**Qisqa javob:** AWS CDK — infratuzilmani **haqiqiy dasturlash tillarida** (TypeScript, Python, Java, Go, C#) yozish imkonini beradi. Kod **CloudFormation template**ga aylantiriladi ("synthesize") va CloudFormation uni deploy qiladi. Asosiy afzallik — **abstraksiyalar** (constructs): bir necha qator kod to'g'ri sozlangan ko'plab resurslarni yaratadi, va til imkoniyatlari (sikl, funksiya, tip, test) ishlatiladi.

### Misol (TypeScript)
```ts
import * as cdk from 'aws-cdk-lib';
import * as ec2 from 'aws-cdk-lib/aws-ec2';
import * as ecs from 'aws-cdk-lib/aws-ecs';
import * as patterns from 'aws-cdk-lib/aws-ecs-patterns';

export class ApiStack extends cdk.Stack {
  constructor(scope: cdk.App, id: string, props?: cdk.StackProps) {
    super(scope, id, props);
    const vpc = new ec2.Vpc(this, 'Vpc', { maxAzs: 3 });
    const cluster = new ecs.Cluster(this, 'Cluster', { vpc });

    new patterns.ApplicationLoadBalancedFargateService(this, 'Api', {
      cluster,
      cpu: 512, memoryLimitMiB: 1024, desiredCount: 3,
      taskImageOptions: { image: ecs.ContainerImage.fromAsset('./app'), containerPort: 8080 },
    });
  }
}
```
Bu ~15 qator: VPC (subnet'lar, NAT, route'lar), ECS klaster, ALB, target group, security group'lar, task definition, IAM role'lar, log group — yuzlab qator CloudFormation.

### Constructs darajalari
- **L1** (`CfnBucket`) — CloudFormation resursining aynan nusxasi.
- **L2** (`Bucket`) — xavfsiz default'lar va qulay metodlar (`bucket.grantRead(role)` — IAM policy avtomatik).
- **L3 / patterns** — butun arxitektura bloklari.
Tashkilot o'z construct kutubxonasini yaratib, standartlarni kodga joylaydi.

### Ish oqimi
```bash
cdk synth          # CloudFormation template generatsiya
cdk diff           # plan analogi
cdk deploy
```
Test: `aws-cdk-lib/assertions` bilan generatsiya qilingan template'ni unit test qilish.

### Trade-off'lar
- **+** Abstraksiya, qayta ishlatish, IDE yordami, tip xavfsizligi, testlar.
- **−** CloudFormation cheklovlari (sekin, stack limitlari, ba'zi xatolarda rollback muammolari).
- **−** Juda ko'p "aqlli" abstraksiya — nima yaratilayotgani yashirin; `cdk diff`ni diqqat bilan o'qish shart.
- Faqat AWS (CDK for Terraform — CDKTF — ko'p cloud, lekin rivojlanishi to'xtatilgan).

**Senior nuqta:** CDK'da IaC "oddiy kod"ga aylanadi — demak kod sifati qoidalari (review, test, murakkablikni cheklash) ham amal qiladi. Deklarativ soddalik yo'qolmasin: infra kodi ichida murakkab biznes mantiq va tashqi API chaqiruvlari — anti-pattern.

